#. type: SH
#: debian-bookworm
#, no-wrap
msgid "AVAILABILITY"
msgstr "DISPONIBILITATE"

#. type: Plain text
#: debian-bookworm
msgid ""
"The B<eject> command is part of the util-linux package which can be "
"downloaded from"
msgstr ""
"Comanda B<eject> face parte din pachetul util-linux care poate fi descărcat "
"de la adresa"
